## Labeller A–B agreement (adjudication-এর আগে, L1)
| SUT | n | Agreement | κ |
|---|---|---|---|
| scout-api | 99 | 81.8% | 0.70 |
| swagger-petstore | 43 | 83.7% | 0.75 |
| market | 13 | 53.8% (BOTH-রীতি মেলালে 100%) | 0.43 |
| cwa-verification | 6 | 100% | 1.00 |
