+    [("/products/{productId}", "get")], "I-REJECT-VALID", ["VALID_REJECTED", "SERVER_ERROR"],
+    "The generic market Exception handler may convert ResponseStatusException into 500 rather than preserve 400. If it does, classify observed I-CRASH instead of claiming VALID_REJECTED. Prefer a direct ResponseEntity guard for a later dedicated reject mutant.",
